{"schema_version":1,"event_id":"sase-g3:000001:issue_created:sase-g3:7e5757f71f6839287705aaf626a36c02fe4728d33c7d20a6ed83b1499225c36d","timestamp":"2026-08-06T12:55:14Z","actor":"bbugyi200.athena.tx","operation":"issue_created","issue_id":"sase-g3","payload":{"kind":"issue_created","issue":{"id":"sase-g3","title":"Diff-scoped selection soundness — measure the blind spot now, stop degrading silently, and stop depending on a CI artifact","status":"open","issue_type":"plan","tier":"epic","parent_id":null,"owner":"bryanbugyi34@gmail.com","assignee":"","created_at":"2026-08-06T12:55:14Z","created_by":"bbugyi200.athena.tx","updated_at":"2026-08-06T12:55:14Z","closed_at":null,"close_reason":null,"description":"The reliability of `just check`'s diff-scoped test lane becomes a measured property rather than an assumed one: a backtest over real historical commits reports selection recall against per-test coverage ground truth today instead of waiting weeks for organic samples, a missing or stale coverage-contexts baseline provokes a named and measured compensating action instead of silently narrowing the selection, an agent can see what the scoped lane actually did on the success path, and a workspace can obtain a baseline from a local full run instead of depending solely on a 14-day CI artifact.","notes":"","design":"plans:202608/selection_soundness.md","model":"","is_ready_to_work":false,"changespec_name":"","changespec_bug_id":"","dependencies":[]}}}
{"schema_version":1,"event_id":"sase-g3:000002:issue_created:sase-g3.1:21eb9702f3c32998da9b4dfbb657ace1c3bbfb6f3951e764376c634c128bd4da","timestamp":"2026-08-06T12:55:18Z","actor":"bbugyi200.athena.tx","operation":"issue_created","issue_id":"sase-g3.1","payload":{"kind":"issue_created","issue":{"id":"sase-g3.1","title":"Historical backtest of selection recall against coverage ground truth","status":"open","issue_type":"phase","parent_id":"sase-g3","owner":"bryanbugyi34@gmail.com","assignee":"","created_at":"2026-08-06T12:55:18Z","created_by":"bbugyi200.athena.tx","updated_at":"2026-08-06T12:55:18Z","closed_at":null,"close_reason":null,"description":"backtest: add a `tools/selection_backtest` harness (plus a `just selection-backtest` recipe) that replays the last N real commits, computes the selection each diff would have produced, and reports recall against per-test coverage-context ground truth — so the epic's unmet exit criterion is answerable now rather than after weeks of organic sample growth.","notes":"","design":"","model":"","size":"medium","is_ready_to_work":false,"changespec_name":"","changespec_bug_id":"","dependencies":[]}}}
